SUMMARY:Elk Creek Road Litter Sweep (Deep Gap)
DESCRIPTION:Help protect wildlife and restore habitat! NCWF High Country Wild is teaming up with Powder Horn Mountain for a trash cleanup along Elk Creek Road and surrounding areas. Litter not only harms wildlife\, but also pollutes the streams and rivers we all depend upon. As an added impact\, every 25 pounds of trash collected results in a native tree planted by North Carolina Wildlife Federation. Refreshments will be provided after the cleanup to all volunteers. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/elk-creek-road-litter-sweep-deep-gap/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/elkcreek.jpg
END:VEVENT
