SUMMARY:Nature’s Secret Superpowers (Holly Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter for a family adventure to explore how animals survive with amazing adaptations. Games\, nature walks\, and wildlife wonders await! This special event is offered by the South Wake Conservationists and will be led by NCWF VP of Outdoor Education\, Mary Bures. Open to kids of all ages as long as they are accompanied by adults. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/natures-secret-superpowers-holly-springs/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
