SUMMARY:Birds & Brews Festival (Asheville)
DESCRIPTION:Join ReWild AVL at the 4th annual one-of-a-kind afternoon at Birds & Brews Festival—where conservation meets community (and great beer). Hosted by Wild Birds Unlimited S. AVL. Join local wildlife organizations\, plant lovers\, and nature enthusiasts for a fun\, educational\, and impactful event—all in support of Wild for Life. The event will feature several local organizations\, including Blue Ridge Audubon Chapter\, ReWild AVL\, and Charlie’s Angels Animal Rescue.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/birds-brews-festival-asheville/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
